------------------------------------------------------

Suppose normally Product Service product data update karti hai product database mai:

Client
   ↓
Product Service
   ↓
Update Product Database
   ↓
Invalidate Product Cache
   ↓
DEL product:101


Lekin kisi business requirement ki wajah se koi doosri service
directly Product Database update kar sakti hai.

